<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%">Dear <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&lt;Sponsor Name&gt;,</span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%">This fall,
you can help fight against blood shortage by participating in the largest blood
donation competition of our lifetime.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%">Your school can
proudly participate in <b>“The</b> <b>We Give Blood Drive,” </b>sponsored by
Abbott and the Big Ten Conference<sub>®</sub>. Tap into the love and
competitiveness of college football and energize your students, alumni, and
fans to donate blood to support their school. We’re calling on all students,
alumni and fans to rebuild the nation’s blood supply by pitting school against
school in a conference-wide donation competition by donating blood with <b><span style="color:red">The American Red Cross</span></b>.&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%">From September
26 – December 6, 2024, donors can participate in <b>“The</b> <b>We Give Blood Drive”</b> by donating blood for their chance
to <b>win tickets to the 2024 Discover® Big Ten<sub>®</sub> Football
Championship Game</b> on December 7, 2024, while also helping your school have
a chance to <b>win $1 million to advance student or community health.*&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></b></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="line-height: 107%;">Joining this
challenge can be done in these easy steps: <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="text-indent: -0.25in;"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="line-height: 107%;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">1.<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -0.25in;"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="line-height: 107%;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">2.<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1. V</span></span></span><span style="line-height: 107%;">isit </span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/give.html/find-drive"><span style="line-height: 107%; color: red;">redcrossblood.org/give</span></a><span style="line-height: 107%; color: red;"> </span><span style="line-height: 107%;">to schedule their Red Cross blood donation
appointment <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="text-indent: -0.25in;"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="line-height: 107%;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">3.<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2. S</span></span></span><span style="line-height: 107%;">ubmit your donation at&nbsp;</span><a href="http://www.bigten.org/abbott" style=""><span style="line-height: 107%;">www.bigten.org/abbott/submit</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;"> <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="text-indent: -0.25in;"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%">For more
information, visit </span><a href="http://www.bigten.org/abbott/cause"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%">www.bigten.org/abbott</span></a><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%">. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%">*</span><span class="ui-provider">This offer </span><strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi">and any resulting prize
during the competition </span></strong><span class="ui-provider">are <i>non</i>-<i>transferable</i> and <i>not</i> redeemable
for cash. Visit </span><a href="https://bigten.votigo.com/fbsweeps/pages/BigTenWeGiveBloodSweepstakes/rules">https://bigten.votigo.com/fbsweeps/pages/BigTenWeGiveBloodSweepstakes/rules</a><span class="ui-provider"> for the terms and conditions of the sweepstakes.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span class="ui-provider"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span class="ui-provider"><i><span style="font-size:9.0pt;
line-height:107%">The American Red Cross is not a sponsor of the sweepstakes
and is not responsible for the creation, execution or fulfillment of the We
Give Blood Drive, or any aspect of the prize. This communication does not
